<http://data.silknow.org/object/5672b0c9-1ae2-3f80-86d4-279dabae24b6>
        a                   ecrm:E73_Information_Object ;
        rdfs:comment        "This embroidery belongs to Group 3 as defined by Jennifer Wearden in 'Azerbaijanian Embroideries: A Synthesis of Contrasts' in Hali Issue 59, October 1991 pp. 102-111.  Group 3 textiles are characterised by  surface darning on the diagonal, usually in pale shades."@en ;
        ecrm:P129_is_about  <http://data.silknow.org/object/9b5dfcce-a5f8-383f-a84a-ff01d420aced> ;
        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/information/bibliography> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "This embroidery belongs to Group 3 as defined by Jennifer Wearden in 'Azerbaijanian Embroideries: A Synthesis of Contrasts' in Hali Issue 59, October 1991 pp. 102-111.  Group 3 textiles are characterised by  surface darning on the diagonal, usually in pale shades."@en .

